    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlowCity Builder is a cozy, relaxing, low-poly fantasy city builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start on an island with a few resources and build your first villager huts to welcome the opening tier of your civilization. As you meet their needs, you\u2019ll unlock new blueprints and advance through four distinct tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tier introduces unique citizen types with their own demands and unlocks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier I:</strong> Villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier II:</strong> Townfolk, Recruits, Acolytes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier III:</strong> Merchants, Soldiers, Apprentices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier IV:</strong> Nobles, Wizards, Priests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each citizen type has a unique set of needs to fulfill, and each provides new blueprints that, in turn, supply the resources and buildings they\u2014or other citizens\u2014require.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game features an easy-to-use building system and a total of 58 unique buildings\u2014some even include different visual variants for a more varied city look.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlowCity Builder is a cozy, relaxing, low-poly fantasy city builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start on an island with a few resources and build your first villager huts to welcome the opening tier of your civilization. As you meet their needs, you\u2019ll unlock new blueprints and advance through four distinct tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tier introduces unique citizen types with their own demands and unlocks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier I:</strong> Villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier II:</strong> Townfolk, Recruits, Acolytes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier III:</strong> Merchants, Soldiers, Apprentices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier IV:</strong> Nobles, Wizards, Priests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each citizen type has a unique set of needs to fulfill, and each provides new blueprints that, in turn, supply the resources and buildings they\u2014or other citizens\u2014require.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game features an easy-to-use building system and a total of 58 unique buildings\u2014some even include different visual variants for a more varied city look.</p>",
    "short_description": "FlowCity Builder is a cozy and relaxing low-poly fantasy city builder. Create big cities from small villages. Manage your resources and fulfill the demands of your citizens!",
